  "serviceDeployment": "ServiceDeploymentFolder/healthcare/StrokeCode.json",
  "documentation": {
    "title": "Stroke code",
    "summary": "A suspected stroke across four organisations: the ambulance service screens and alerts; the comprehensive stroke centre holds its angiography suite; the receiving hospital orders CT and bloods together from the regional imaging and pathology providers; the telestroke neurologist at the stroke centre decides on clot-dissolving treatment at the receiving hospital and clot retrieval at the stroke centre. Every route that will not retrieve a clot signals the stand-down process, which releases the suite hold."
  },
